    'Ken Sirius Nigeria Limited works with buyers seeking lithium, copper, and cassava from Africa. We support commodity enquiries, commercial discussions, and trade documentation.': 'Ken Sirius Nigeria Limited 为寻求非洲锂、铜和木薯的买家提供支持，协助处理商品询价、商务洽谈和贸易文件。',
    'Request a Quote': '申请报价', 'Explore Our Products': '浏览产品', 'Abuja, Nigeria': '尼日利亚阿布贾',
    'OUR PRODUCTS': '我们的产品', 'Commodities We Focus On': '重点商品',
    'Our current focus is lithium, copper, and cassava. Product specifications, availability, quantities, and commercial terms are confirmed during each enquiry.': '目前我们重点关注锂、铜和木薯。产品规格、供应情况、数量和商务条款均需在每次询价中确认。',
    'Battery Minerals': '电池矿物', 'Industrial Metals': '工业金属', 'Agricultural Commodities': '农产品',
    'For buyers seeking lithium materials for industrial and battery supply chains. Product form, grade, and availability are subject to confirmation.': '面向寻找工业及电池供应链锂材料的买家。产品形态、品位和供应情况需确认。',
    "For buyers seeking copper for industrial and electrical applications. Product specifications and supply terms are discussed based on the buyer's requirements.": '面向寻找工业和电气用途铜产品的买家。产品规格和供应条款根据买家需求商议。',
    'For buyers seeking cassava and related products for food or industrial use. Product form, quality requirements, and availability must be confirmed.': '面向寻找食品或工业用途木薯及相关产品的买家。产品形态、质量要求和供应情况需确认。',
    'View Lithium': '查看锂产品', 'View Copper': '查看铜产品', 'View Cassava': '查看木薯产品',
    'HOW WE WORK': '我们的工作方式', 'Clear Terms.': '条款清晰。', 'Careful Coordination.': '协调周全。',
    "Every enquiry starts with understanding the buyer's requirements. We discuss product specifications, quantities, destination, documentation, and commercial terms before a transaction proceeds.": '每项询价都从了解买家需求开始。在交易推进前，我们会讨论产品规格、数量、目的地、文件和商务条款。',
    'Understand the Requirement': '了解需求', 'We review the requested commodity, specifications, quantity, and destination.': '我们确认所需商品、规格、数量和目的地。',
    'Agree on Commercial Terms': '商定商务条款', 'We discuss pricing, delivery arrangements, payment terms, and other contract requirements.': '我们讨论价格、交付安排、付款条件和其他合同要求。',
    'Review Documentation': '审核文件', 'We identify the product, inspection, and export documents relevant to the transaction.': '我们确定交易所需的产品、检验和出口文件。',
    'Coordinate the Transaction': '协调交易', 'Once terms are agreed, the parties proceed with the applicable contract, inspection, shipment, and payment arrangements.': '条款商定后，各方按约定安排合同、检验、运输和付款。',
    'How We Trade': '贸易流程', 'OUR BUSINESS PRINCIPLES': '我们的经营原则',
    'A Practical Approach to Commodity Trade': '务实的商品贸易方式',
    'We believe successful commodity transactions depend on clear communication, accurate information, and agreed commercial terms.': '我们认为，成功的商品交易取决于清晰沟通、准确信息和双方商定的商务条款。',
    'Clear Communication': '清晰沟通', 'We aim to provide accurate information and clarify outstanding requirements early.': '我们努力提供准确信息，并尽早明确尚待解决的要求。',
    'Product Requirements': '产品要求', 'We address specifications, quantities, packaging, and destination for each enquiry.': '我们针对每项询价确认规格、数量、包装和目的地。',
    'Documentation': '文件资料', 'We identify relevant company, product, and export documents based on the transaction.': '我们根据交易确定相关公司、产品和出口文件。',
