    'Providing a few key details helps us assess your request and identify the next steps.': '提供几项关键信息有助于我们评估需求并确定后续步骤。',
    'Required product form and specification.': '所需产品形态和规格。', 'Quantity required.': '所需数量。', 'Destination country and delivery preference.': '目的国家和交付偏好。', 'Inspection and documentation requirements.': '检验和文件要求。', 'Required product form.': '所需产品形态。', 'Quality or processing requirements.': '质量或加工要求。', 'Quantity and packaging.': '数量和包装。', 'Destination and applicable documentation.': '目的地及适用文件。',
    'If you do not have every detail, send us the information available and we can clarify the outstanding requirements.': '如果您尚未掌握所有细节，请先发送现有信息，我们可以进一步确认其他要求。',
    'Submit an Enquiry': '提交询价', 'OUR LONG-TERM VIEW': '我们的长期愿景', 'Supporting More Value from African Resources': '提升非洲资源的价值',
    'Africa has opportunities to create more value from its natural resources through local processing, industrial investment, and stronger supply chains. Ken Sirius supports responsible trade and partnerships that contribute to this goal.': '非洲可通过本地加工、工业投资和更强大的供应链，从自然资源中创造更多价值。Ken Sirius 支持有助于实现这一目标的负责任贸易与合作。',
