    'THE PROCESS': '流程', 'From Enquiry to Shipment': '从询价到发运', 'The process and timelines depend on the product, destination, and agreed arrangements.': '流程和时间取决于产品、目的地和双方商定的安排。',
    'Enquiry': '询价', 'Share your product requirements and destination.': '说明产品需求和目的地。', 'Review': '审核', 'Clarify specifications, quantity, and documentation.': '确认规格、数量和文件要求。', 'Quotation': '报价', 'Discuss pricing and proposed commercial terms.': '讨论价格和拟定商务条款。', 'Agreement': '协议', 'Confirm the contract and payment arrangements.': '确认合同和付款安排。', 'Arrange applicable inspection and documentation.': '安排适用的检验和文件。', 'Shipment': '发运', 'Proceed according to the agreed transaction terms.': '按照商定的交易条款执行。', 'View Our Process': '查看贸易流程',
    'Looking for a Commodity Supplier?': '正在寻找大宗商品供应商？', 'Send us your product requirements, quantity, and destination. Our team can review the enquiry and discuss the next steps.': '请发送产品需求、数量和目的地。我们的团队将审核询价并讨论后续步骤。',
    'Frequently Asked Questions': '常见问题', 'Trade enquiries': '贸易询价', 'Which commodities does Ken Sirius focus on?': 'Ken Sirius 主要经营哪些商品？', 'Our current focus is lithium, copper, and cassava.': '目前重点关注锂、铜和木薯。',
    'How do I request a quote?': '如何申请报价？', 'Submit the quote form with your commodity, quantity, specifications, and destination. We can follow up on any missing details.': '请在报价表中填写商品、数量、规格和目的地。缺少的信息可后续补充。',
    'Are all products available immediately?': '所有产品都能立即供应吗？', 'Availability must be confirmed for each enquiry. Submitting a request does not guarantee supply.': '每项询价的供应情况均需确认。提交申请不代表保证供应。',
    'Can I request specific product grades?': '可以指定产品品位吗？', 'Yes. Include your required grade or specification so it can be reviewed as part of the enquiry.': '可以。请注明所需品位或规格，以便纳入询价审核。',
    'Can you provide product documentation?': '可以提供产品文件吗？', 'Relevant documentation can be discussed based on the product, transaction, and documents available.': '可根据产品、交易和现有文件讨论相关资料。',
    'Do you support international trade enquiries?': '是否接受国际贸易询价？', 'You can contact us with your destination, delivery requirements, and proposed commercial terms for review.': '您可以告知目的地、交付要求和拟定商务条款，供我们审核。',
    'Which payment and delivery terms are accepted?': '接受哪些付款和交付条款？', 'Payment and delivery terms are subject to discussion and agreement for each transaction.': '付款和交付条款需针对每笔交易讨论并达成一致。',
    'Availability, specifications, documentation, and commercial terms are confirmed for each enquiry.': '供应情况、规格、文件和商务条款均需针对每项询价确认。',
    'Have a Commodity Requirement?': '您有商品采购需求吗？', 'Contact Ken Sirius with your product, quantity, and destination details to begin a trade enquiry.': '请联系 Ken Sirius，提供产品、数量和目的地信息以开始贸易询价。', 'Contact Us': '联系我们',
