    'Ken Sirius Nigeria Limited is a Nigerian company focused on lithium, copper, and cassava trade enquiries.': 'Ken Sirius Nigeria Limited 是一家尼日利亚公司，专注于锂、铜和木薯贸易询价。', 'Registered in Nigeria · RC 7321954': '尼日利亚注册 · RC 7321954', 'All rights reserved.': '版权所有。',
    'ABOUT KEN SIRIUS': '关于 KEN SIRIUS', 'About Ken Sirius': '关于 Ken Sirius', 'Connecting African Commodities to Global Buyers': '连接非洲商品与全球买家',
    'Ken Sirius Nigeria Limited is a Nigerian company focused on lithium, copper, and cassava trade enquiries. We work to connect commodity opportunities with buyers seeking clear product information and commercial terms.': 'Ken Sirius Nigeria Limited 是一家尼日利亚公司，专注于锂、铜和木薯贸易询价。我们致力于连接商品机会与寻求清晰产品信息和商务条款的买家。',
    'Company overview': '公司简介', 'Who We Are': '关于我们', 'Ken Sirius Nigeria Limited focuses on commodity trade involving lithium, copper, and cassava. Our work centres on buyer enquiries, product requirements, commercial discussions, and relevant trade documentation.': 'Ken Sirius Nigeria Limited 专注于锂、铜和木薯商品贸易。我们的工作包括买家询价、产品要求、商务洽谈和相关贸易文件。',
    'We aim to build business relationships through clear communication, accurate information, and agreed terms.': '我们致力于通过清晰沟通、准确信息和商定条款建立业务关系。', 'Company registration': '公司注册信息', '01 / Purpose': '01 / 使命', 'Our Mission': '我们的使命',
    'To connect buyers with African commodity opportunities through clear communication, responsible business practices, and professional trade coordination.': '通过清晰沟通、负责任的商业实践和专业贸易协调，将买家与非洲商品机会相连接。', '02 / Direction': '02 / 愿景', 'Our Vision': '我们的愿景',
    'To contribute to the growth of African commodity trade and support opportunities for local processing, industrial development, and stronger supply chains.': '促进非洲商品贸易发展，支持本地加工、工业发展和更强大的供应链机会。', 'Our values': '我们的价值观', 'How We Work': '我们的工作方式', 'Our principles guide how we communicate, review requirements, and conduct business.': '我们的原则指导沟通、需求审核和业务开展。',
    'Integrity': '诚信', 'We communicate honestly and set clear expectations.': '我们诚实沟通并明确预期。', 'Transparency': '透明', 'We aim to provide accurate information about products, terms, and outstanding requirements.': '我们努力准确说明产品、条款和待确认事项。', 'Quality Awareness': '质量意识', 'We recognise the importance of product specifications, testing, and relevant documentation.': '我们重视产品规格、检测和相关文件。', 'Long-Term Relationships': '长期合作关系', 'We value professional conduct, mutual understanding, and reliable communication.': '我们重视专业行为、相互理解和可靠沟通。',
    'Commodity focus': '商品重点', 'Three Areas of Focus': '三个重点领域', 'Battery minerals': '电池矿物', 'Industrial metals': '工业金属', 'Agricultural commodities': '农产品',
    'Our approach to African trade': '我们的非洲贸易方式', 'Trade Today.': '立足当下贸易。', 'Build Long-Term Value.': '创造长期价值。', 'African commodities serve a range of industrial and agricultural markets. We believe trade can create greater value when product requirements are clear, transactions are properly documented, and business relationships are built on realistic expectations.': '非洲商品服务于多种工业和农业市场。我们认为，明确产品要求、妥善记录交易并建立切合实际的业务关系，有助于创造更多价值。',
    'Explore Our Industrialization Vision': '了解我们的工业化愿景', 'Get in touch': '联系我们', 'Let’s Discuss a Business Opportunity': '探讨业务合作机会', 'Contact Ken Sirius to discuss a commodity requirement, a potential partnership, or a business enquiry.': '联系 Ken Sirius，讨论商品需求、潜在合作或业务咨询。',
